sequenceDiagram

    autonumber

    participant C as Cliente

    participant API as FastAPI /ask

    participant UC as execute_rag

    participant RP as run_rag_pipeline

    participant RS as RetrievalStrategy

    participant PS as PromptStrategy

    participant F as get_generation_strategy

    participant GS as GenerationStrategy

    participant DB as PostgreSQL pgvector

    participant LLM as Ollama ou OpenAI



    C->>API: POST question, scenario, top_k

    API->>UC: ExecuteRAGInput

    UC->>UC: _select_strategies()

    UC->>F: LLM_PROVIDER

    F-->>UC: Ollama ou OpenAI strategy

    UC->>RP: question, top_k, strategies



    RP->>RS: retrieve(session, question, top_k)

    alt rag_rerank

        RS->>DB: top_k expandido

        RS->>RS: CrossEncoder rerank

        RS-->>RP: top_k final

    else rag_basic / rag_optimized

        RS->>DB: busca cosseno

        RS-->>RP: top_k chunks

    else llm

        RS-->>RP: lista vazia

    end



    RP->>PS: build_context + build_prompt

    RP->>GS: generate(prompt)

    GS->>LLM: invoke / chat completion

    LLM-->>GS: resposta

    GS-->>RP: LLMGenerationResult

    RP-->>UC: RAGPipelineResult



    UC->>DB: experiment_runs (log)

    UC-->>API: resultado

    API-->>C: answer, chunks, scores, tokens

